# Workspace-wide pattern (covers every app/package's node_modules, not enumerated by hand).
**/node_modules

.git
**/.git

# build output
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/generated
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# test/coverage
**/coverage

# logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# OS/editor cruft
**/.DS_Store

# not part of the Docker deliverable
plan
.claude
